BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:AI Series: AI for Finance and Budget Optimization
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T103000
UID:9170e21f09c7feccbd57324fb3d7a765@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Strong financial decisions start with clear\, accessible data.
  As part of the Founders Collective- a partnership between the Wake Forest
  Area Chamber\, the Wake Forest Business & Industry Partnership\, and The 
 Loading Dock- this session will explore practical ways AI can help busines
 s owners strengthen financial planning and make more confident decisions. 
 Led by Will Mendoza of i90\, participants will discover how AI-powered too
 ls can support cash flow forecasting\, analyze pricing strategies\, organi
 ze expenses\, and uncover trends that lead to better business decisions. T
 he focus is on practical\, real-world applications that improve financial 
 visibility while complementing- not replacing- the expertise of financial 
 professionals. This will be an interactive\, hands-on session. Attendees a
 re encouraged to bring a laptop and\, if possible\, have an AI assistant s
 uch as Chat GPT\, Claude\, Gemini\, or Microsoft Copilot already installed
  or accessible so they can follow along with live demonstrations
LOCATION:Wake Forest\, NC
URL:https://chambermaster.wakeforestchamber.org/events/details/ai-series-a
 i-for-finance-and-budget-optimization
X-SOURCE:Wake Forest Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
