 ea generation\, visual concepts\, and iterative design\, helping teams mov
 e from concept to refinement more efficiently. The emphasis on practical w
 orkflows that support creativity and informed decision-making. You'll lear
 n how to: ​Generate and refine product or service ideas using AI Create 
 quick prototypes and visual concepts Analyze feedback to improve and itera
 te on ideas
