BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Inaugural Fall Oyster Roast
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261015T150000
UID:6072b222dbac01b8bfbedf1f74f6bf0d@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Pull up a chair\, grab a cold drink\, and join us for an eveni
 ng of great food\, great company\, and one of the South's favorite traditi
 ons. The Wake Forest Area Chaber's Fall Oyster Roast\, presented by Wildbe
 rry Pediatric Dentistry\, is a relaxed outdoor gathering designed to bring
  together Chamber members\, business leaders\, and the community for an un
 forgettable fall evening. Whether you're a longtime oyster enthusiast or j
 ust coming for the barbecue\, fire pits\, music\, and conversation\, there
